-- Seeds the 5 metadata_concept_kind values that had zero canonical
-- concepts (season, garment_type, climate, silhouette, weight_band),
-- plus a matching knowledge_objects card per concept, generated via
-- DeepSeek from a fixed 27-topic list covering each kind's common
-- values. knowledge_topic has no equivalent enum values for these
-- kinds, so each is mapped to the closest existing topic: season ->
-- occasion, garment_type -> styling, climate -> performance,
-- silhouette -> styling, weight_band -> fabric.

